cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Shiny-Sturgeon, please cite the software using the metadata below.
  Please also cite the classifier papers: the Sturgeon V2 preprint
  (preferred-citation) and, for Sturgeon v1, the Nature 2023 paper (references).
title: "Shiny-Sturgeon"
abstract: >-
  A local Shiny GUI for live intraoperative Sturgeon methylation
  classification of Oxford Nanopore sequencing runs.
type: software
